<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fall 45 pct over week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fall 45 pct over week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 300,742 tonnes in the week to May 20, from 544,909 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said on Wednesday.</p>
